  "description": "WordPress-style page-level comments for Umbraco. Members comment on any page; comments are held in transactional tables and guarded by the same moderation engine as Community Forum (shared DigitalWonderlab.CommunityCore) - deterministic rules always on, optional AI overlay via the Umbraco.AI add-on. Editors place comments with the Comments block (no code) or the Commentable composition. Free to use.",
